      "writtenOn": "2024-03-20T12:59:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMHO validating if (ret \u003e MESSAGE_IN_SIZE) at this point is too late. It is responsibility of the PDC driver (call to dev-\u003epd-\u003eexecute_cmd(dev-\u003epd-\u003edev, control, message_in)) to make sure it does not write data beyond boundary of message_in. In case when a bad behaving PDC driver writes beyond message_in buffer then validating ret is pointless here as overwrite already happened and if it didn\u0027t crash us then we might as well print all the bytes with the DLOG_HEXDUMP.",
